Suppose that a weight function $(c_1,\ldots,c_5)$ makes $P_5$ levelable.  Then 
\[(c_1+c_3+c_5)+(c_2+c_4) = (c_1+c_4)+(c_2+c_5).\]
Consequently $c_3 =0$, contradicting the fact that
the entries of $(c_1,\ldots,c_5)$ are all positive.  

